{"4648360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Savior Method", "steam_appid": 4648360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4648360/extras/a25a45dbdd9fa31ff19ea7e6d09c0bf2.avif?t=1783335804\" width=1300 height=619 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Savior Method</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different characters, all possessing 4 different traits granted by the universe. They are all Saviors and were created for the greater good!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what is their purpose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil reigned supreme on Earth; people had forgotten what love, happiness, and positivity meant. Evil had made them forget their own languages, and all of humanity spoke the same language, just like robots. This was no ordinary occurrence, because forgetting their own language meant every human losing their soul and becoming identical. This situation reached the ears of the Savior team. To find the best way to teach people their languages and to fight against the evils of the world, they initiated a project dedicated to the theme of the &quot;ISLANDS MISSION&quot; as their workspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work alongside the Saviors in the ISLANDS MISSION, and become a Savior yourself!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ISLAND MISSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four different islands, 1 player on each island, and only one winner... Are you ready for a strategic battle where you protect your own island while uncovering the value of your opponents?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Rules and Objective of the Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decode the Value, Defeat Your Opponent:</strong> Every player has boxes containing hidden Witness Cards on their island. Your objective is to infiltrate your opponents' islands and correctly answer the questions inside these boxes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Golden Rule of Winning:</strong> At the end of the game, the player whose questions in their boxes are the least known (meaning they protected their value the best) becomes the winner of the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE BOXES ON EACH ISLAND WHERE WITNESS CARDS ARE ATTACHED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4648360/extras/9eb2ec94b24f65ff54243eca1971e071.avif?t=1783335804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4648360/extras_big/9eb2ec94b24f65ff54243eca1971e071.avif?t=1783335804 width=1560 height=1390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VALUABLE VEHICLES FROM WHICH AMMUNITION IS OBTAINED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4648360/extras/92dc5353963090e1ed72f29c890e5354.avif?t=1783335804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4648360/extras_big/92dc5353963090e1ed72f29c890e5354.avif?t=1783335804 width=1560 height=644 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create a Room &amp; Join a Room</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a Room:</strong> Create a private room for 4 people, send the code to your friends, and start your own game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join a Room:</strong> Enter the game by typing in the code of the created room.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Click Matchmaking:</strong> Press the &quot;Quick Play&quot; button and play with online players worldwide.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4648360/extras/65557d3b7c7e67c503bb4999d685f485.avif?t=1783335804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4648360/extras_big/65557d3b7c7e67c503bb4999d685f485.webp?t=1783335804 width=1560 height=873 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4648360/extras/a25a45dbdd9fa31ff19ea7e6d09c0bf2.avif?t=1783335804\" width=1300 height=619 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Savior Method</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different characters, all possessing 4 different traits granted by the universe. They are all Saviors and were created for the greater good!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what is their purpose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil reigned supreme on Earth; people had forgotten what love, happiness, and positivity meant. Evil had made them forget their own languages, and all of humanity spoke the same language, just like robots. This was no ordinary occurrence, because forgetting their own language meant every human losing their soul and becoming identical. This situation reached the ears of the Savior team. To find the best way to teach people their languages and to fight against the evils of the world, they initiated a project dedicated to the theme of the &quot;ISLANDS MISSION&quot; as their workspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work alongside the Saviors in the ISLANDS MISSION, and become a Savior yourself!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ISLAND MISSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four different islands, 1 player on each island, and only one winner... Are you ready for a strategic battle where you protect your own island while uncovering the value of your opponents?</p>