n a Room:</strong> Enter the game by typing in the code of the created room.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Click Matchmaking:</strong> Press the &quot;Quick Play&quot; button and play with online players worldwide.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4648360/extras/65557d3b7c7e67c503bb4999d685f485.avif?t=1783335804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4648360/extras_big/65557d3b7c7e67c503bb4999d685f485.webp?t=1783335804 width=1560 height=873 /></span></p>", "short_description": "4 Saviors, which aims to relearn languages against the evil that transforms the world into a robot, offers players a cross-island challenge that they can play with their friends or online opponents. Work together with the Saviors and become a Savior yourself.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Bulgarian, Danish, Indonesian, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Hungarian, Malay, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Greek, Czech, Swedish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4648360/c1fe6ace70586e7eb06c858888b79424f130e7a4/header.jpg?t=1783335804", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4648360/24cf51a4c76f6afe4efea4809bbbfa78e2ed6814/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783335804", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4648360/24cf51a4c76f6afe4efea4809bbbfa78e2ed6814/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783335804", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\